steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558400/extras/5b7f6416a356b29ff0f44725b0eeafbe.poster.avif?t=1757793312\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558400/extras/5b7f6416a356b29ff0f44725b0eeafbe.webm?t=1757793312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smash</strong>, <strong>shunt</strong>, and <strong>crash</strong> your way through one big detour of a journey taking you up mountains, down subway tunnels, onto insane highways and through secret government facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558400/extras/aca980b9f5d6128fdb25ec1ac822fdd3.poster.avif?t=1757793312\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558400/extras/aca980b9f5d6128fdb25ec1ac822fdd3.webm?t=1757793312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left! Left! No, RIGHT! Stop stop<strong> STOP!! </strong>The couple that jives together drives together. If the passenger gives good directions (and the driver can follow them) you\u2019re guaranteed a smooth and blissful cruise. But when something goes wrong \u2014 which it will \u2014 it\u2019s <i><strong>both</strong></i><strong> </strong>of your faults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558400/extras/b98c6e2e9a768ab762fe5a75a1973ddb.poster.avif?t=1757793312\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558400/extras/b98c6e2e9a768ab762fe5a75a1973ddb.